        // Move 5 (odd): swap 0 and 1
        // Move 6 (even): swap 1 and 2

        // Let's track where a ball starting at position p ends up after 6 moves.
        // Start at 0:
        // 0 -> swap 0,1 -> 1 -> swap 1,2 -> 2 -> swap 0,1 -> 2 -> swap 1,2 -> 1 -> swap 0,1 -> 0 -> swap 1,2 -> 0
        // So 0 -> 0 after 6 moves.

